# OAuth / OIDC

Implement per `docs/OAUTH_V2_INTEGRATION.md`. Entry: `sakrylleAuth.ts`.

## Redirect URI

`${window.location.origin}/oauth/callback`; SSR fallback `https://image.sakrylle.com/oauth/callback`. **Whitelist is in sub2api DB — do not change redirect URIs in this repo.**

## v2 canonical scopes

`profile:read account:read account:balance:read models:read images:create responses:create offline_access`. OIDC adds `openid profile email`.

## Token invariants

- **`refresh_token` must rotate on every refresh** — missing = terminal error
- Auto-refresh at `expiresAt - 60s`; 401 → `forceRefreshToken` → single retry (`dedupedForceRefresh` for concurrency)
- `refreshTokenExpiresAt` is family-anchored (absolute, not rolling)
- `tokenFromPayload`: both auth-code and refresh paths pass `requireRefresh: true`
- `main.tsx` callback: log only `err.message` (errors may contain token fragments)

## Storage keys

- `sakrylle-image-playground.auth` (localStorage) — full `SakrylleAuthToken`
- `sakrylle-image-playground.pkce-verifier` / `.pkce-state` / `.oidc-nonce` (sessionStorage)
- `sakrylle-image-playground.selected-groups` / `.group-names` (localStorage)

## OIDC (feature flag)

When `VITE_SAKRYLLE_OIDC_ENABLED=true`: discovery via `sakrylleOidcDiscovery.ts` (1h cache), parse id_token (no sig verify), nonce replay protection, `logoutAndRevoke()` uses RP-initiated logout.

## Multi-group

`refreshWithGroupId(groupId)` rotates without changing main token. `getGroupAccessToken()` reads without triggering refresh (concurrency-safe for model selector).

When changing OAuth/OIDC behavior, update `oidc-docs/` in the same change.
